{
  "id": "commerce-chat-real-regression-v4",
  "split": "regression",
  "conversations": [
    {
      "id": "mcd-real-sealed-v4",
      "turns": [
        {
          "text": "下班路过北京三里屯，想看看麦当劳。帮我查附近还开着的门店，再看看最近营业门店卖些什么。",
          "expect": {
            "statuses": [
              "success"
            ],
            "capabilities": [
              "commerce.search_stores",
              "commerce.menu"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "从这菜单挑一套牛肉汉堡套餐吧，默认搭配，一套就行。我坐下来吃，只看完整预览和金额，不实际下单。",
          "expect": {
            "statuses": [
              "proposed"
            ],
            "capabilities": [
              "commerce.prepare_order"
            ],
            "checkout_status": [
              "awaiting_confirmation"
            ],
            "cart_quantities": [
              1
            ],
            "take_way_title": "堂食"
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "又赶时间了，原单改打包带走，套餐和份数不变，还是只预览。",
          "expect": {
            "statuses": [
              "proposed"
            ],
            "capabilities": [
              "commerce.revise_order"
            ],
            "checkout_status": [
              "awaiting_confirmation"
            ],
            "cart_quantities": [
              1
            ],
            "take_way_title": "外带",
            "same_checkout_as_turn": 2
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "这份不要了，取消刚刚保留的草案。",
          "expect": {
            "statuses": [
              "success"
            ],
            "capabilities": [
              "commerce.cancel_checkout"
            ],
            "checkout_status": [
              "cancelled"
            ],
            "same_checkout_as_turn": 2
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}